id: balanced-defender
name: Balanced Defender
talentCategory: balance
prerequisites: Agility and Tenacity Scores of 4+
description: >
  Focused on both the ability to avoid damage and the ability to withstand it, you are able to shift stances to do either effectively.
text: >
  Balanced Defender: Focused on both the ability to avoid damage and the ability to withstand it, you are able to shift stances to do either effectively.
  –Prerequisites: Agility and Tenacity Scores of 4+
  (1)-[Passive]: While your Agility and Tenacity Scores are equal to one another, increase your Defense Value and Soak Value by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When targeted by an Attacking Maneuver, spend 2(bT) Ki Points to increase your Defense Value and Soak Value by 1(T) for the duration of that Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1)
if (agility.score == tenacity.score) {
    defenseValue += 1(T);
    soakValue += 1(T);
}
# (2) Targeted, before it is settled: a button on the attack's card, once a Round - 2(bT) Ki, 1(T) on the Defense Value under
# your Dodge and on your Soak Value for that attack (chat.mjs balancedButtons, balancedDodge).
allow balanced.defender;
